A snapshot before the unsupported position can still be valued.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ valuation: 'cost', accounts: ['Assets:*'], denominate: true, to: '2024-01-01' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
commodity FUND
commodity EUR
P 2024-01-01 FUND 10 SEK
P 2024-01-01 EUR 12 SEK
2024-01-01 Opening cash
  Assets:Cash  5 SEK
  Equity:Opening
2024-01-02 Missing acquisition cost
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND {2 EUR}
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "5"
  }
]
